    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 252,
        "text": "Good evening, everyone. Thanks for coming to the community garden meeting. I know it's late, but we have a lot to decide. First, let's talk about the budget for next season. We have 500 dollars from the local council, and we need to spend it wisely.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "textHash": "a8d0c6754befa0f948d0816873eb7954aacf41ea4d79ed6d66122a41e199c226",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 257,
        "sourceEnd": 360,
        "text": "Sorry to interrupt, but didn't we get 600 dollars last year? I thought the council increased our grant.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "dcd06ab98bb827f56391b90f50de5256b5e204e546f43e42ce5827f43bcaafe2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 365,
        "sourceEnd": 661,
        "text": "No, that was two years ago. Last year we got 450 dollars. This year it's 500. So we have a little more than last year, but less than two years ago. Anyway, we need to allocate the money. I suggest we spend 200 dollars on new tools, 150 on seeds and plants, and the rest on compost and fertilizer.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "textHash": "4a8013dd40fb5b61b69796073cbfefbfa5d712b863f24e5e4239352e5136a2fe",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 666,
        "sourceEnd": 817,
        "text": "That sounds reasonable. But what about the water bill? We still owe 80 dollars for last summer. If we don't pay it, the water company might cut us off.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "d43b2684c5137de17959f12f98eb182c57e98a1ac81d3b1dac50505c39a50665",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 822,
        "sourceEnd": 956,
        "text": "Good point. I forgot about that. So let's take 80 dollars from the compost budget. That leaves 70 dollars for compost. Is that enough?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "textHash": "cb9b86d4bb85afa13ee9d12064677498ba7545fe4b62f60ff7c3a7ffb52d21ff",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 961,
        "sourceEnd": 1053,
        "text": "Probably. We can also ask members to bring kitchen waste for compost. That would save money.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "296ebea0675b3fbcc8260f90fc58807729ab323acf54dc5c440cee6db12369d0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1058,
        "sourceEnd": 1293,
        "text": "Great idea. Now, about the schedule. We need to check our progress every month. Last year we only checked twice, and we had problems with the tomatoes. This year, I propose we have a monthly check on the first Saturday. Any objections?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "textHash": "17e4681a2ef327d16aca4f1172b0a57a7c1b6e09665fc04188cf74097baa1c67",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1298,
        "sourceEnd": 1394,
        "text": "No objections, but can we make it the second Saturday? The first Saturday is always busy for me.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "8d52f50730a3fb1fbeae0118ddef272dbd2ffbae09d88c2347d41b5baa9990b2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1399,
        "sourceEnd": 1534,
        "text": "OK, let's make it the second Saturday. Now, who will be responsible for the checks? We need someone to write a short report each month.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "textHash": "12b1e2144b9d82cd025f457987214b189f62810b48f57cee32c692d43e861f95",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1539,
        "sourceEnd": 1645,
        "text": "I can do that. I'm good at writing reports. But I'll need help with the photos. Maybe Tom can take photos?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "d0497d721bb001b2ec063236bad5d701fa598260175a999a29561d08ad4cf71f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1650,
        "sourceEnd": 1903,
        "text": "Yes, Tom is good with cameras. I'll ask him. So, to summarize: budget is 500 dollars, we spend 200 on tools, 150 on seeds, 80 on the water bill, and 70 on compost. Monthly checks on the second Saturday, reports by you, photos by Tom. Any other business?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "textHash": "05d222bc7a004b5c97ba7e3f6fd94ec8176dcd4039f8c8a951f8dac7f8c9b940",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1908,
        "sourceEnd": 1987,
        "text": "Just one thing. The shed needs painting. Can we use some of the money for that?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "630d59c66d219ffd473c6dd7087f7f50039f6b70f6e250a40c510e7ef2fcb82b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1992,
        "sourceEnd": 2161,
        "text": "Hmm, we don't have extra money. But maybe we can ask for donations of paint. I'll put a notice on the community board. If we get paint, we can paint the shed next month.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "textHash": "f4ad5969070174c7cbe80794ec1233a6152901bfc7b9c31264edf8d954c748a8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 2166,
        "sourceEnd": 2212,
        "text": "OK. That sounds like a plan. Thanks, everyone.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "ee6967f7dc892891aad25abd0b9dc260530ee7ee2524a3ab996305d0ebc8f488",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
